1
00:00:00,531 --> 00:00:02,871
(Raj:)-What do you say?
-I don't say anything.

2
00:00:03,033 --> 00:00:07,623
(Sheldon:)I merely offer you a facial expression
that suggests you've gone insane.

3
00:00:09,039 --> 00:00:12,879
(Raj:)-I don't get it. You had a great time.
-Yes, exactly. I had a great time.

4
00:00:13,043 --> 00:00:15,043
(Sheldon:)That's done.
I've moved on to other things.

5
00:00:15,212 --> 00:00:19,262
(Sheldon:)For example, after I learn Finnish,
I'm not going to learn Finnish again.

6
00:00:19,425 --> 00:00:20,885
(Raj:)Please, Sheldon.

7
00:00:21,051 --> 00:00:23,431
(Raj:)I'm a lost Indian boy far from home...

8
00:00:23,637 --> 00:00:26,267
(Raj:)...and I want a girlfriend,
and I want her to be Abby...

9
00:00:26,432 --> 00:00:29,022
(Raj:)...and she'll only come
if she can bring Martha.

10
00:00:29,184 --> 00:00:31,684
(Sheldon:)I highly doubt
there is any argument you can make...

11
00:00:31,854 --> 00:00:35,904
(Sheldon:)...threat you might levy,
rhetorical strategy, plea, invocation...

12
00:00:36,066 --> 00:00:41,116
...supplication or "vetoomus"
that you can employ...

13
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:44,070
(Sheldon:)...that would convince me
to reconsider.

14
00:00:57,463 --> 00:01:03,023
(Raj:)My Incredible Hulk hands
signed by Stan Lee.

